---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <BaseHead title={`Simulations | ${SITE_TITLE}`} />
</head>

<body>
  <Header />

  <main class="simulations-page">
    <h1>Simulations</h1>

    <section class="simulation">
      <h2>RADIATIVE FEEDBACK FROM POPULATION III PROTOSTARS</h2>

      <p>
        The movie shows radiative feedback of a wide eccentric Pop III binary
        presented in
        <a
          href="https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023MNRAS.521.5334P/abstract"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Park et al. (2023a)
        </a>.
        At the pericenter, the tidal force between the circumstellar minidisks
        boosts the accretion onto the central protostars. When the accretion
        rate exceeds a critical value, the protostars become bloated and the
        temperature drops. Due to this effect, the stars emit fewer UV photons
        and the surrounding gas cools down. As the stars move away from each
        other and the accretion rate drops, radiative feedback begins again.
      </p>

      <div class="video-container">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/DEBqgUmGgCk"
          title="Radiative Feedback from Population III Protostars"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</body>
</html>

<style>
  .simulations-page {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .simulations-page h1 {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .simulation h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .simulation p {
    max-width: 950px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .simulation a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .video-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1080px;
    aspect-ratio: 1080 / 630;
  }

  .video-container iframe {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .simulations-page {
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .simulations-page h1 {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
